{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026mdXaBWsSyp1792749751.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>據報內地加強審查上市公司分拆，最快於明年發布指引。</p><p></p><p>《彭博》引述知情人士透露，內地證券監管機構正加強對上市公司分拆業務上市的審查，已表明不鼓勵企業將盈利能力最強的業務板塊，分拆出去單獨上市，認為可能對母公司股東不公平，同時監管機構要求分拆出的業務，應與母公司處於不同領域，以減少業務重疊及關聯方交易。</p><p></p><p>報道指，審查範圍涵蓋內地，以及香港股市的分拆上市申請，最快明年正式公布新指引。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T13:04:44.735410+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":190,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T10:01:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T04:18:11.664890+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T12:58:18.147275+00:00","content_hash":"92822446e37cb9780eb88f6043588badffdf11b637927f3eb5b3f71f259656f2","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-23T13:04:44.735410+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}